WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.000
Starting in a deep squat position.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.500
Walking hands forward into a full plank.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.100
Performing a clean push-up repetition.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.500
[Trainer approaches and assesses form]

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Trainer corrects posture, maintaining a straight back.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Holding the correct plank position.